desc: Jet Lag (Classic Flanger RE-01 port) by chmaha
author: chmaha
version: 1.0
changelog:
  Initial release.
about:
  Stereo flanger with a vintage flavour: delay, LFO rate, sine or triangle LFO, depth, feedback with a polarity
  switch, stereo LFO phase and dry/wet mix, plus 9 factory presets. Classic Flanger RE-01 is AnClark Liu's
  recreation of a much-loved free studio flanger from the early 2000s; this port matches its DSP.
  Ported from Classic Flanger RE-01 by AnClark Liu (GPL-3.0-or-later) https://github.com/AnClark/ClassicFlanger-RE01
  Title lettering drawn from the outlines of Knewave by Tyler Finck (SIL Open Font License 1.1)
  JSFX version released under GPL-3.0-or-later
  Claude generated some of this code
